# Generated qualification evidence — NOT source.
#
# Everything here is produced by a run on one machine and is archived as a CI
# artifact / evidence tarball instead of being tracked (see reports/RECEIPT.md
# for where a given run's artifacts live). What stays tracked is the runner,
# the mutation script, the frozen input manifest, the findings/receipt docs and
# the reproduction commands.
#
# Everything below is regenerated by:
#   bash qualification/build-manifest.sh
#   python3 qualification/qualify.py --group all --limit 0 --ops save,font,font-plan,preserve --idempotence
#   python3 qualification/qualify.py --lane recovery --group general|generated --limit 0

# generated trees and bulk observations
inputs/
outputs/
failures/
sources/
baselines/
reports/*.json
reports/*.log
recovery/mutated/
recovery/repaired/
recovery/records/
recovery/reports/
__pycache__/

# Kept on purpose (curated, small, human-readable):
#   reports/FINDINGS-full-sweep.md
#   reports/RECEIPT.md
